    "description": "<p>By adding +5m to the Cost of Unswerving Juggernaut Principle, the destiny of the Sidereal's journey enmeshes him, pulling him ever forward and shielding him from hindrances to his progress. This provides the following benefits:</p><ul><li>The Sidereal ignores penalties to his Dodge DV.</li><li>The character can Dash reflexively, though this still makes it impossible to block attacks normally.</li><li>The Exalt gains an additional +10L/10B soak against any unexpected attacks.</li><li>The Seer adds (Athletics) extra successes to rolls to give or evade pursuit during chase scenes, as well as dramatic tracking/evasion scenarios.</li></ul>",
